		line=887,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030130"},
		line=887,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The sun dawns on August 8th.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"All the members of the Sworn Blades are gathered in the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"We are here to mourn those who lost their lives during the August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori lights some incense on behalf of all those gathered, and we all sink into a moment of silence.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They will not be forgotten!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“On this day two years ago, many brave souls were taken away from us, including our former chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is surely the providence of Oomikami that on this day today, I am able to announce the date of our planned uprising!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Everyone's expressions tighten at this declaration.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This coming August 16th, we shall rise up as one.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Three days after the Republican governor-general departs, we will take back our Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The solemn atmosphere lingering from our moment of silence is dispelled at once by a simmering furor.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"─At last, our day has come.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Not a single person dares to speak their thoughts aloud, but every single pair of eyes I meet burns with this conviction.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As you well know, the Sworn Blades are ostensibly in an alliance with Senior Colonel Elsa Valentine.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At present, the only forces protecting Okonogi in the Imperial Palace are Republican soldiers under Elsa's direct command.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“On the day of our uprising, the Republican Army will clear a path to Okonogi without engaging our forces.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“After we equip ourselves at our headquarters, we will march directly on the Imperial Palace and there, we shall strike Okonogi down!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Hotori takes the time to make eye contact with each warrior in attendance.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"As she does, the fervor of the room swells up more and more.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“After we defeat Okonogi, we will secure Empress Hisui and escort Her Majesty to Iseya in order to establish a provisional government.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Her Majesty will declare our independence and issue a call to arms to the 200,000-strong Imperial police force, undeclared warriors, and all other volunteers.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If independence movements are sparked up all across the country, the Republic will have no choice but to meet us at the negotiation table.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There, Her Majesty will be able to propose a truce with the Republic in exchange for our independence.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That concludes today's briefing on Operation Bellflower.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your squad leaders will have more detailed orders for you.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"As soon as Hotori ends her speech, the individual squads immediately begin their own strategy briefings.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Every last warrior's eyes shine with a vivid spark.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"For three long years since the war, the Sworn Blades have patiently bided their time, awaiting this day of reckoning.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"It would be plainly unreasonable to tell them not to get excited.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's finally time, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Even Akari's face is faintly flushed with excitement.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you sure you don't want to reveal your identity?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I announced myself now, I'd just be causing unnecessary confusion.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Until the Republicans sign that truce, I'm happy to just be another warrior charging into battle alongside everyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Personally, I still want Akari to take command, but she makes a valid point.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, one sec.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Hotori slides up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just got word from Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The broadcast is all set to go whenever.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Naturally, the Kurushima Group has a broadcasting subsidiary.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"On the day of our uprising, we plan to have Empress Hisui speak directly to us from the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui is on our side now, so everything's going off without a hitch.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only thing we need to still worry about... is Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Even now, we can't bring ourselves to fully trust her.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"We can't rule out the possibility that she'll spring a trap on us right after we defeat Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If only we had some proof that she won't betray us.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If worst comes to worst, we've made arrangements for the possibility that she does.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like what?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“On the day of the uprising, we'll have Koyuzu stick to her like glue.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Seems like Akari gets the idea.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"If Elsa looks like she's going to betray us, our spy Koyuzu will neutralize her before she gets the chance.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"She spares Hotori from having to say it directly.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's pray that Koyuzu doesn't get any chance to shine.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Phew...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I collapse onto my bed the moment I return to my room.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"For once, I spent all day wandering around the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Onii-sama gave me this mission, so of course I would try to fulfill it to the best of my ability!",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"...Though I was not able to come up with any results.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The servants working in the Imperial Palace hardly knew anything about the Shireiden or the Three Sacred Treasures.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"If anything, I spent more time giving them information, such as explaining where the Shireiden was.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"To think that Onii-sama would finally depend on me, and yet I was unable to help him in any way...",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"A sudden knock on the door interrupts my thoughts, and I reflexively correct my unbecoming posture.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Come in.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The chancellor takes an irritatingly long time to close the door before turning to face me.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"He pierces me with a sharp glint in his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Been awfully active on your feet today, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"This is the way he talks to me whenever we're alone together.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Just the sound of his frosty voice is enough to send a chill up my spine.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“There is a matter on which I have some small curiosity.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I manage to squeak out a proper response.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The knowledge that I'm doing all this for Onii-sama's sake fills me up with courage.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Considering my role, I thought it prudent to familiarize myself with them, that I might be able to answer any questions if asked.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"The chancellor hideously raises an eyebrow.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Were you able to learn anything?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Regrettably, I was not.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Three Sacred Treasures are the most prized Artifacts within all the Empire. None but the Empress herself are permitted to lay their hands upon them.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I hereby forbid you from taking any further interest in this matter.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"His expression unchanging, he mechanically barks his orders out like clockwork.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Do I make myself clear?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Answer me!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"His mismatched eyes glare straight at me.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I can spot my own reflection in his artificial eye returning his glare with a hardened expression.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How insolent you've recently become...”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Have you been meeting some bad influences?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"The chancellor looms menacingly over me.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Go ahead and strike me if you want.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"A daughter of warriors would never give you the satisfaction of crying out in pain.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Wipe the Three Sacred Treasures from your mind.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The chancellor raises his scepter above his head.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Suddenly, another knock on the door.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Mmh...?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"His raised hand freezes in place.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Come in.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Just the person I was hoping for casually steps her way inside.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Why, Elsa-sama! How pleasant it is to see you.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"She acknowledges the chancellor with the smallest of nods before striding up next to my side.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, am I interrupting you?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Not at all, I do not mind.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, you have my most sincere gratitude for your efforts in guarding the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Truly, your net is so tight that not even an ant could slip through.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The warriors are surely beside themselves with consternation.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll be sure to keep it up moving forward as well.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"The chancellor's words contain not one hint of genuine respect, and Elsa-sama indifferently shrugs them off.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How proceeds your campaign against the warriors as of late?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I do believe you are hatching a secret plan to wipe them all out in one fell swoop, are you not?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Huh?)”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I involuntarily give Elsa-sama a sidelong glance.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Our eyes meet for the briefest of moments, but she quickly averts her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Lord Chancellor, we ought refrain from discussing such uncouth matters in Her Majesty's presence.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Why, this is a matter which concerns the very peace of the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I do believe Her Majesty has the right to be informed.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, whatever might your secret plan entail?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, it is a matter of utmost secrecy, so I am afraid I cannot reveal it even to Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahaha, how terribly intriguing.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Indeed, even the governor-general awaits the day the warriors are eradicated with bated breath.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The chancellor chuckles in amusement.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do look forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How positively reassuring.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I, too, look forward to seeing the palace halls lined with the warriors' heads.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Well then, I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Okonogi bows and withdraws.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, um... What the chancellor just said...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Merely an excuse to steal away the rights to palace security, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I led Okonogi to believe that I have a secret plan to wipe out the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, is that how it is?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do apologize. It gave me quite the fright.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You should've learned by now to not take the chancellor at his word so easily.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Elsa-sama shows me a refreshing smile as she busies herself with preparing some tea.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"There's an uncharacteristic sheen of sweat glistening on her forehead.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"...A cold sweat?",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Does that mean that Elsa-sama truly is plotting against the warriors?",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The doubt swirls around in my head and slowly solidifies into conviction.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"─Elsa-sama is lying to me.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"When it comes to Onii-sama, my intuition has never once been wrong.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(I must inform Onii-sama.)”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I hear you've been doing quite some investigating around the Imperial Palace today.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, you received word of that?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Three Sacred Treasures are the ≪regalia≫ of the Imperial Family, are they not?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“≪Regalia?≫”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heirlooms that are representative of royal authority.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Have you sparked some interest in trying to prove that\nyou're the genuine article?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It was merely a whim of idle curiosity. There is no deeper meaning to it.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now is an awfully important time, you know? Do take care to avoid drawing the chancellor's undue attention.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Elsa-sama offers me a cup of tea with a perfect smile on her lips.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Her expression is kind as usual, but the smile doesn't quite seem to reach her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Her inner thoughts appear to be at odds with what she is saying.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"I have a bad feeling about this.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I see you are also monitoring me, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't make me sound like such a villain.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm just taking my precautions to ensure that no danger befalls you.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Besides that, it helps put me at ease to know that you\nwon't elope with Tokita-kun the first chance you get.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Me, elope?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee, I suppose one can dream.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama would never allow it, but oh, what a joyous thought that is.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Just imagining it has me on cloud nine.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you seriously in love with him? You're kidding, right?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How does it seem to you, Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Romantic feelings between family members are unacceptable.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama and I are not related by blood.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even still.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you've lived together for a long time, you're still each\nother's family.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"It seems Elsa-sama has a strong sense of propriety.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Or perhaps her values are shaped by some Republican religion.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You are speaking to the woman who dared impersonate the Empress. It would be immaterial to me even if we were related by blood.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The only thing that scares me is the thought of dying with unfulfilled regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's impossible to get through to you with logic, huh? It makes my head hurt whenever I talk with you.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa-sama scowls, massaging her temples.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, perhaps you ought to break out of your own shell as well?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You have no idea of all the things you might start seeing in a whole new light.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Indeed, the moment I decided to live my life for Onii-sama, all the trivial concerns of everyday life simply melted away.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"All that matters to me now is holding on to this wonderful feeling in my heart, no matter what anyone else might say.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're saying I'm stuck inside a shell?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why indeed. You are a shellfish among shellfish, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My, my. That's some nice attitude you've developed.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks for the concern, but you don't need to worry your pretty little head over me.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is that so? I beg your pardon then, in that case.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Elsa-sama lets out a theatrical sigh.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd thought you were just a meek little girl, but it seems like I had the wrong idea.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why, I believe I am meek enough to give a lamb a run for its money.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hardly. You're a regular runaway mare who'd do anything for her precious Onii-sama, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyway, just don't do anything stupid.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
